# Invariant 10: handshakes and application ciphertext are kept for 30 days, and a device away for
# longer finds the log pruned behind it. Bob's catch-up is answered E_PRUNED, and he returns by an
# own-leaf external commit to the instance's head instead - after which what alice sends reaches
# him again. Nothing he missed is served to him out of a log that no longer holds it.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
group chat kind=text target=dcdcdcdcdcdcdcdcdcdcdcdcdcdcdcdc community=none creator=alice
join bob chat via=welcome
sync bob
go_offline bob
send alice chat sent before bob came back
advance_clock 31d
expect_reject E_PRUNED go_online bob
resync bob chat
sync alice
send alice chat after the resync
expect_decrypts bob chat after the resync
